Subject: [PATCH 32/66] Glint: reference bookmark UX - empty by default, header
 folder button creates folders, always-live tree

---
 .../frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc   | 96 +++++++++----------
 .../frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.h    |  9 +-
 2 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 57 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc
